              "main": {
                "contentmodel": "wikitext",
                "contentformat": "text/x-wiki",
                "*": "== {{int:filedesc}} ==\n{{Information\n|Description={{en|[[:en:Tunnel Beach, New Zealand|Tunnel Beach]], close to [[:en:Dunedin|Dunedin]], [[:en:New Zealand|New Zealand]]. The tunnel down to the beach is approximately at the base of the 'T' of the cliff peninsula, and goes down to the beach at the left.}}\n{{fr|Tunnel Beach, près de [[:fr:Dunedin|Dunedin]], [[:en:Nouvelle-Zélande|Nouvelle-Zélande]]. L'entrée du tunnel descendant vers la plage se situe près de la base des falaises de la péninsule en 'T'. Il relie la prairie à la plage située à gauche.}}\n|Source={{Transferred from|en.wikipedia}}<br/>\n({{original text|nobold=1|1=Own picture.}})\n|Date=2005-06\n|Author={{user at project|Ingolfson|wikipedia|en}}<br/>\n({{original text|nobold=1|1=Uploader.}})\n|Permission=PD-self. Changed to public domain while moving to Commons.\n|other_versions=\n}}\n\n== {{int:license-header}} ==\n{{PD-self}}\n\n== {{original upload log}} ==\n{{original description page|en.wikipedia|TunnelBeachNZ_I.jpg}}\n* 2006-11-27 05:56 [[:en:User:Ingolfson|Ingolfson]] 1600×1200×8 (236649 bytes) ''<nowiki>{{Information |Description = [[Tunnel Beach, New Zealand]], close to [[Dunedin]]. The tunnel down to the beach is approximately at the base of the 'T' of the cliff peninsula, and goes down to the large beach at the left. |Source = Own picture. |Date = 200</nowiki>''\n\n[[Category:June 2005 New Zealand photographs]]\n[[Category:Tunnel Beach]]\n[[Category:Photos taken by Ingolfson]]\n[[Category:Coasts of New Zealand]]\n[[Category:Fences in New Zealand]]\n[[Category:2005 in Dunedin]]"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
